分上下！前提是某些人真的没有提前偷看题目，冥思苦想了...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB8BB5C569565DCF8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1027404007:1":{"text":"<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style> 님은 단 한 번 보고 답을 알았으니, 이제 어떤 실력인지 알겠지?","source_cn":"<style=stress><player_name>...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x18B9377E00E50A4F","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style> 님은 단 한 번 보고 답을 알았으니, 이제 어떤 실력인지 알겠지?","female":"<style=\"stress\"><player_name></style> 님은 단 한 번 보고 답을 알았으니, 이제 어떤 실력인지 알겠지?","variant_male_record_index":"108010","variant_female_record_index":"108011","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1027404008:1":{"text":"이봐, 토끼 귀 오빠. 수수께끼 푸는데 그쪽 몫은 없는 것 같은데?","source_cn":"嘿，兔耳朵小哥，你在解密里又出了多少力？！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCC0958DB518B16E1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1027404009:1":{"text":"나... 나는... 분위기를 띄웠잖아! <style=\"stress\"><player_name></style> 님 칭찬도 했고!","source_cn":"我——我——充分活跃了气氛！而且给予了<style=s...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x72AD4AC120055801","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"나... 나는... 분위기를 띄웠잖아! <style=\"stress\"><player_name></style> 님 칭찬도 했고!","female":"나... 나는... 분위기를 띄웠잖아! <style=\"stress\"><player_name></style> 님 칭찬도 했고!","variant_male_record_index":"108013","variant_female_record_index":"108014","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:13:1027404009":{"text":"나... 나는... 분위기를 띄웠잖아! <style=\"stress\"><player_name></style> 님 칭찬도 했고!","source_cn":"我——我——充分活跃了气氛！而且给予了<style=stress><player_name></style>应有的赞美！","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x72AD4AC120055801","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"나... 나는... 분위기를 띄웠잖아! <style=\"stress\"><player_name></style> 님 칭찬도 했고!","female":"나... 나는... 분위기를 띄웠잖아! <style=\"stress\"><player_name></style> 님 칭찬도 했고!","variant_male_record_index":"108013","variant_female_record_index":"108014","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1027404010:1":{"text":"지... 진심이시죠...?","source_cn":"感觉你在阴阳怪气，是我的错觉吗？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xBF5D6C823ED6BD68","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"지... 진심이시죠...?","female":"지... 진심이시죠...?","variant_male_record_index":"108015","variant_female_record_index":"108016","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1027404011:1":{"text":"좋아, 그럼 이제 제물을 어디서 찾을지 단서는 있어?","source_cn":"很好，那么接下来，祭品去哪里找，你们有头绪吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x57D610B8564F7CA9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1027404012:1":{"text":"특히, 토끼 귀 오빠! 그 귀 사이에 있는 작은 머리 좀 잘 굴려보라고!","source_cn":"尤其是你，兔耳朵小哥，让你双耳之间那个小玩意运转起来—...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x76C345726BEBE39E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:17:1027404012":{"text":"특히, 토끼 귀 오빠! 그 귀 사이에 있는 작은 머리 좀 잘 굴려보라고!","source_cn":"尤其是你，兔耳朵小哥，让你双耳之间那个小玩意运转起来——好好思考！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x76C345726BEBE39E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1027404013:1":{"text":"물론이죠! 정품 보장 깃털! 브라이언의 동료, 아름다운 엘로나에게서 가져왔어요!","source_cn":"当然！铛铛！如假包换的翎羽！来自布莱恩的伙伴，美丽的艾洛娜！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE76223DFA995FC90","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1027404014:1":{"text":"...미리 말해두지만 빠진 깃털을 주운 거고, 절대로 뽑은 거 아니에요!","source_cn":"——事先声明，这是她脱羽时我捡的！完全无害！绝对没有拔毛！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEA6FB70286DF9FDC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:20:1027404014":{"text":"...미리 말해두지만 빠진 깃털을 주운 거고, 절대로 뽑은 거 아니에요!","source_cn":"——事先声明，这是她脱羽时我捡的！完全无害！绝对没有拔毛！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEA6FB70286DF9FDC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:23:1027404015:0":{"text":"“물”의 물고기... 마침 달빛호수 마을에 낚시를 좋아하는 사람들이 많으니, 가서 하나 사올게요.","source_cn":"“水”的鱼……正好，月湖村有不少村民酷爱钓鱼，我去买一...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4E4B272D4A32C085","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:24:1027404015":{"text":"“물”의 물고기... 마침 달빛호수 마을에 낚시를 좋아하는 사람들이 많으니, 가서 하나 사올게요.","source_cn":"“水”的鱼……正好，月湖村有不少村民酷爱钓鱼，我去买一条吧，很快就回来。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4E4B272D4A32C085","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:25:1027404016:1":{"text":"흥, 쉬운 일만 골라서 하네.","source_cn":"哼，还真是会捡轻松的活儿啊。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD7ADC3741497E78B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:26:1027404016":{"text":"흥, 쉬운 일만 골라서 하네.","source_cn":"哼，还真是会捡轻松的活儿啊。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD7ADC3741497E78B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:27:1027404017:1":{"text":"...쯧, 그래. 사슴 영혼의 보물에 비하면 고작 보물 한두 개 정도는...","source_cn":"……啧，好吧，好吧，比起鹿灵的宝藏，一两块宝石而已……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE799CAAC0F525C2D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:28:1027404018:1":{"text":"젠장... 그건 정말 순수하고 희귀한 보석이야! 아무렇게나 찾을 수 있는 게 아니라고!","source_cn":"可恶……那可是纯净度很高、很稀少的宝石！不是随随便便能...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF2F5E2A441555D23","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:29:1027404019:1":{"text":"너희들이 나머지 제물을 찾아봐. 난 여기서 기다릴 테니.","source_cn":"你们去找其余祭品吧，我在这儿等你们收集回来。","status":"matched_runtime_